    "updated_at": "2022-12-04T18:57:21Z",
    "body": "On a cursory glance things largely look the same. [stale-while-revalidate](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5861#section-3) is not listed in [Cache Directive Registration](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9111#name-cache-directive-registratio), but is still listed in [IANA HTTP Cache Directive Registry](https://www.iana.org/assignments/http-cache-directives/http-cache-directives.xhtml). I don't really know how changes like this work, so I'm likely missing something.",
