    "created_at": "2022-12-05T04:20:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-12-05T04:20:10Z",
    "body": "FWIW, the HTTP specs use 'header fields' etc. consistently, but also [acknowledge](https://httpwg.org/specs/rfc9110.html#header.fields) that they're often referred to just as 'headers'.",
